{"speciesId":2,"names":{"fr":"Herbizarre","es":"Ivysaur","en":"Ivysaur","ja":"フシギソウ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"When the bulb on its back grows large, it appears to lose the ability to stand on its hind legs."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"When the bulb on its back grows large, it appears to lose the ability to stand on its hind legs."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"The bulb on its back grows by drawing energy. It gives off an aroma when it is ready to bloom."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Exposure to sun­ light adds to its strength. Sunlight also makes the bud on its back grow larger."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"If the bud on its back starts to smell sweet, it is evidence that the large flower will soon bloom."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The bulb on its back grows as it absorbs nutrients. The bulb gives off a pleasant aroma when it blooms."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"There is a bud on this POKéMON’s back. To support its weight, IVYSAUR’s legs and trunk grow thick and strong. If it starts spending more time lying in the sunlight, it’s a sign that the bud will bloom into a large flower soon."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"There is a bud on this POKéMON’s back. To support its weight, IVYSAUR’s legs and trunk grow thick and strong. If it starts spending more time lying in the sunlight, it’s a sign that the bud will bloom into a large flower soon."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"To support its bulb, IVYSAUR’s legs grow sturdy. If it spends more time lying in the sunlight, the bud will soon bloom into a large flower."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"There is a plant bulb on its back. When it absorbs nutrients, the bulb is said to blossom into a large flower."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When the bulb on its back grows large, it appears to lose the ability to stand on its hind legs."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Exposure to sunlight adds to its strength. Sunlight also makes the bud on its back grow larger."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If the bud on its back starts to smell sweet, it is evidence that the large flower will soon bloom."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Lorsque le bourgeon sur son dos éclot, il répand un doux parfum pour célébrer sa floraison."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Lorsque le bourgeon sur son dos éclot, il répand un doux parfum pour célébrer sa floraison."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il y a un bulbe sur son dos. On dit que s’il absorbe assez de nutriments, ce bulbe se transforme en une jolie fleur."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Este Pokémon tiene un bulbo en el lomo. Dicen que, al absorber nutrientes, el bulbo se transforma en una flor grande."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"There is a plant bulb on its back. When it absorbs nutrients, the bulb is said to blossom into a large flower."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"つぼみが 背中に ついていて 養分を 吸収していくと 大きな 花が 咲くという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Lorsque le bourgeon sur son dos éclot, il répand un doux parfum pour célébrer sa floraison."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando el bulbo de su lomo se hincha, desprende un dulce aroma para indicar el florecimiento."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"背中の つぼみが ふくらみ出すと 甘い においが 漂いはじめる。 大輪の 花が 咲く 前触れ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un bourgeon a poussé sur le dos de ce Pokémon. Pour en supporter le poids, Herbizarre a dû se muscler les pattes. Lorsqu’il commence à se prélasser au soleil, ça signifie que son bourgeon va éclore, donnant naissance à une fleur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Este Pokémon lleva un bulbo en el lomo y, para poder con su peso, tiene unas patas y un tronco gruesos y fuertes. Si empieza a pasar más tiempo al sol, será porque el bulbo está a punto de hacerse una flor grande."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"There is a bud on this Pokémon’s back. To support its weight, Ivysaur’s legs and trunk grow thick and strong. If it starts spending more time lying in the sunlight, it’s a sign that the bud will bloom into a large flower soon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"つぼみを 支えるため 足腰が 強くなる。 日なたで じっとする 時間が 長くなれば いよいよ 大輪の 花が 咲くころだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un bourgeon a poussé sur le dos de ce Pokémon. Pour en supporter le poids, Herbizarre a dû se muscler les pattes. Lorsqu’il commence à se prélasser au soleil, ça signifie que son bourgeon va éclore, donnant naissance à une fleur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Este Pokémon lleva un bulbo en el lomo y, para poder con su peso, tiene unas patas y un tronco gruesos y fuertes. Si empieza a pasar más tiempo al sol, será porque el bulbo está a punto de hacerse una flor grande."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"There is a bud on this Pokémon’s back. To support its weight, Ivysaur’s legs and trunk grow thick and strong. If it starts spending more time lying in the sunlight, it’s a sign that the bud will bloom into a large flower soon."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"つぼみを 支えるため 足腰が 強くなる。 日なたで じっとする 時間が 長くなれば いよいよ 大輪の 花が 咲くころだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"En emmagasinant de l’énergie, son bulbe grossit. Un arôme en émane quand il s’apprête à éclore."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Su bulbo crece a medida que absorbe nutrientes. Desprende un cierto aroma cuando está a punto de florecer."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"The bud on its back grows by drawing energy. It gives off an aroma when it is ready to bloom."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"養分を 摂って 大きくなった つぼみから 香りが 漂いだすと もうすぐ ハナが開く 証拠だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"En emmagasinant de l’énergie, son bulbe grossit. Un arôme en émane quand il s’apprête à éclore."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Su bulbo crece a medida que absorbe nutrientes. Desprende un cierto aroma cuando está a punto de florecer."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"The bud on its back grows by drawing energy. It gives off an aroma when it is ready to bloom."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"養分を 摂って 大きくなった つぼみから 香りが 漂いだすと もうすぐ ハナが開く 証拠だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Son bulbe dorsal est devenu si gros qu’il ne peut plus se tenir sur ses pattes postérieures."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando le crece bastante el bulbo del lomo, pierde la capacidad de erguirse sobre las patas traseras."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When the bulb on its b